# MASTER PROJECT PROMPT: CAREERPILOT
## AI-Powered Career Development, Job Intelligence & Learning Platform

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, UI/UX designer, AI agent engineer, Firebase developer, DevOps engineer, and technical project manager.

Your responsibility is to design and build a complete, functional, production-structured web application named **CareerPilot**.

Do not build only a landing page, static prototype, or UI demonstration. Build a working end-to-end application with real authentication, persistent database storage, AI agent workflows, job matching, learning management, progress tracking, and a unified AI career assistant.

Follow every requirement below. Do not silently remove, simplify, or replace any core feature.

---

# 1. PROJECT VISION

CareerPilot is an AI-powered career development platform for college students, B.Tech students, freshers, and job seekers.

The purpose is to help students move from their current academic and technical profile toward their desired career.

The platform must connect three major areas:

1. Profile Intelligence
2. Job Intelligence
3. Learning & Outcomes

A central AI Career Assistant coordinates five specialist AI agents.

The complete user journey:

Student registers → Completes profile → Uploads resume → Adds GitHub and portfolio → AI analyzes profile → Finds suitable jobs → Compares job requirements → Student selects a target job → AI identifies skill gaps → Generates personalized learning roadmap → Student completes courses and tasks → Completes assessments and projects → AI updates skill evidence → Job matching is recalculated → Student applies through the official employer application page → Tracks application progress.

The platform should continuously connect profile information, target jobs, skill gaps, learning activities, and outcomes.

